# Python bytecode / caches from the tools harness
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Blender auto-save backups
*.blend[0-9]

# Release-staging tree (Phase 60sq2.5) — a reproducible build artifact. The compressor is
# deterministic at the pinned encoder+flags (compress_textures.py), the freeze hash-lock
# (freeze_release.py) + the determinism gate guarantee integrity, so the (large) BCn .dds
# derivatives are regenerated via `stage_release.py build`, never committed.
library/staging/
